period":"2026-01-02","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/864749/000086474926000015/trmb-20260102.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Trimble is a leading technology solutions and platform provider, enabling office professionals and field workers to connect their workflows and industry lifecycles, driving a more productive, efficient, and sustainable future. With a focus on the industries that build, maintain, and move the world, the comprehensive depth and breadth of our solutions are transforming the way the world works, making it easier for Trimble customers to focus on what matters—getting the job done right.","zh":"Trimble 是一家領先的技術解決方案和平台提供商，使辦公室專業人員和現場工作人員能夠將他們的工作流程和行業生命週期連接起來，推動更有效率、更永續的未來。我們的解決方案專注於建立、維護和推動世界的產業，其全面的深度和廣度正在改變世界的運作方式，使 Trimble 客戶能夠更輕鬆地專注於重要的事情——正確完成工作。"},{"en":"We innovate at the intersection of the digital and physical worlds with solutions that span the world's foundational industries, including building, civil and infrastructure construction, geospatial, natural resources, utilities, and transportation.","zh":"我們在數位世界和物理世界的交叉點上進行創新，提供涵蓋世界基礎產業的解決方案，包括建築、土木和基礎設施建設、地理空間、自然資源、公用事業和運輸。"},{"en":"We exist to empower our customers: asset owners; general and specialty contractors; architects, engineers, and designers; surveyors; energy and utility companies; transportation shippers and carriers; as well as state, federal, and municipal governments. Productivity and sustainability are at the heart of who we are—woven into our work internally and through our customers' application of our technologies. Our solutions provide customers with the ability to improve their work quality while being safe, efficient, and sustainable.","zh":"我們的存在是為了幫助我們的客戶：資產所有者；總承包商和專業承包商；建築師、工程師和設計師；測量師；能源和公用事業公司；運輸托運人和承運人；以及州、聯邦和市政府。生產力和永續發展是我們的核心——融入我們的內部工作並透過客戶對我們技術的應用。我們的解決方案使客戶能夠在安全、高效和永續的同時提高工作品質。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our segments are distinguished by the markets they serve. Each segment consists of businesses that are responsible for product development, marketing, sales, strategy, and financial performance. We report our financial performance, including revenue and operating income, based on three reportable segments: Architects, Engineers, Construction, and Owners (\"AECO\"), Field Systems, and Transportation and Logistics (\"T&L\"). For further financial information about our segments, see Note 8 \"Segment and Geographic Information\" in Item 8 of this report.","zh":"我們的細分市場以其所服務的市場而聞名。每個部門都由負責產品開發、行銷、銷售、策略和財務績效的業務組成。我們根據三個可報告部門報告我們的財務業績，包括收入和營業收入：建築師、工程師、施工和業主（「AECO」）、現場系統以及運輸和物流（「T&L」）。有關我們分部的更多財務資訊，請參閱本報告第 8 項中的附註 8「分部和地理資訊」。"},{"en":"The AECO segment primarily serves organizations across architecture, engineering, construction, and asset ownership through a connected lifecycle solution. Within this segment, our most substantial product portfolios are focused on architectural and interior design, structural and civil engineering, building and infrastructure construction, and the operations and maintenance of assets. Products are sold through a multi-channel approach, including direct, indirect, and digital channels.","zh":"AECO 部門主要透過互聯的生命週期解決方案為建築、工程、施工和資產所有權領域的組織提供服務。在這一領域，我們最重要的產品組合集中在建築和室內設計、結構和土木工程、建築和基礎設施建設以及資產的運作和維護。產品透過多通路方式銷售，包括直接、間接和數位通路。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We continue to opportunistically divest businesses that no longer fit within our strategy. On February 8, 2025, we completed the sale of our global transportation telematics (\"Mobility\") business to Platform Science, Inc. (\"Platform Science\") resulting in our ownership, or rights to acquire ownership of 32.5% of Platform Science's expanded business with an approximate fair value of $253.9 million. The transaction aims to enhance driver experience, fleet safety, efficiency, and compliance by combining two cutting-edge in-cab commercial vehicle ecosystems, which gives customers access to more applications and offerings.","zh":"我們繼續機會主義地剝離不再符合我們策略的業務。 2025 年 2 月 8 日，我們完成了將全球交通遠端資訊處理（「行動」）業務出售給 Platform Science, Inc.（「Platform Science」）的交易，使我們擁有或有權獲得 Platform Science 擴展業務 32.5% 的所有權，公允價值約為 2.539 億美元。該交易旨在透過結合兩個尖端的駕駛室內商用車生態系統來增強駕駛員體驗、車隊安全、效率和合規性，使客戶能夠獲得更多應用程式和產品。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"Field Systems","val":1539500000,"zh":"現場系統部門"},{"name":"Architects Engineers Construction & Owners","val":1498600000,"zh":"建築師、工程師、建築和業主部門"},{"name":"Transportation & Logistics","val":549200000,"zh":"交通物流部門"}],"total":3587300000},"prod":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"Subscription & Services","val":2452100000,"zh":"訂閱與服務"},{"name":"Product","val":1135200000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":3587300000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"North America","val":2075900000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":1905800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":1021600000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":349700000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Restof World","val":140100000,"zh":"世界其他地區"}],"total":3587300000}},"peers":["TDY","PTC","ZBRA","TYL","TER"]}}